Package: knbsdata
Title: Discover, Retrieve and Cite Official Kenyan Statistics
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(c("Mustapha", "Wasseja"), "Mohammed", , "muswaseja@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(c("Pascal", "Ochieng"), "Owiti", role = "aut",
           comment = c(affiliation = "Kenya National Bureau of Statistics"))
  )
Description: Provides a consistent interface for discovering and
    retrieving official data and statistical products of the Kenya
    National Bureau of Statistics (KNBS): its survey archive
    <https://statistics.knbs.or.ke/nada/>, publications library, census,
    consumer price and economic data portals
    <https://opendata.knbs.or.ke/beta/databrowser/>, the open FinAccess
    survey microdata <https://finaccess.knbs.or.ke/>, and the Kenya
    Demographic and Health Survey indicators published through the DHS
    Program API <https://api.dhsprogram.com/>. Standardises them into
    documented schemas, preserves provenance metadata such as release
    dates and checksums, and generates reproducible citations. This is an
    independent open-source project and is not an official KNBS product.
